YibinThesis is an unofficial, independently implemented template.

The source code in this repository was written for this project. No source code,
class file, bibliography style, logo, cover artwork, or school-specific command
set was copied from the universities listed below. Their public repositories
were reviewed only for high-level engineering patterns such as key-value
metadata, separation of front/main/back matter, modular chapters, build
automation, and documentation layout:

- UESTCthesis: https://github.com/shifujun/UESTCthesis
- GZHU Report LaTeX Version:
  https://github.com/swq123459/GZHU-Report-Latex-Version
- tongjithesis: https://github.com/SXKDZ/tongjithesis
- scuthesis: https://github.com/fatestigma/scuthesis
- NEU bachelor thesis template:
  https://github.com/Acytoo/neu_bachelor_thesis_template
- bjtuThesis: https://github.com/chenzewei01/bjtuThesis
- ZJU CS/SE undergraduate design template:
  https://github.com/zhanghai/zju-csse-undergraduate-design-latex-template
- BIThesis: https://github.com/BITNP/BIThesis

Institutional names, logos, seals, wordmarks, and other identifying assets are
not covered by the MIT License in this repository. Their use remains subject to
the rights and rules of the relevant institution.

The layout rules were derived from user-supplied Yibin University thesis
requirements and a local 2024 Word template. Those source documents are not
redistributed in this repository.
